DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppppmmttooeeyyuuvv  reads  a  PPM image as input and produces a Berkeley Encoder
       YUV (not the same as Abekas YUV) file on the Standard Output file.

       With no argument, ppppmmttooeeyyuuvvtakes input from Standard Input.  Otherwise,
       _p_p_m_f_i_l_e is the file specification of the input file.

       ppppmmttooeeyyuuvv handles multi-image PPM input streams, outputting consecutive
       eyuv images.  There must be at least one image, though.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       There are no command line options defined specifically  for  ppppmmttooeeyyuuvv,
       but it recognizes the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm
